<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">HKO · OFFICIAL TIDE TABLE</view><view class="title">官方站点潮汐</view><view class="sub">抱歉 仅有免费站点</view><picker range="{{stations}}" value="{{stationIndex}}" bindchange="station"><view class="picker">香港 · {{stations[stationIndex]}} ⌄</view></picker><view class="label">日期</view><picker range="{{dateOptions}}" value="{{dateIndex}}" bindchange="date"><view class="picker">{{date}} ⌄</view></picker><view class="sub">{{name}}站距所选天气地点约{{distance}}km。本站潮表只代表本站，不会作为远处大陆地点的本地潮汐。</view><view class="card"><view class="sub">{{message}}</view><view class="chart" wx:if="{{bars.length}}"><view wx:for="{{bars}}" wx:key="time" class="bar" style="height:{{item.height}}rpx"/></view><view class="row sub"><text>00时</text><text>23时</text></view><view class="sub">{{valid}}/24小时有效 · 香港海图基准面CD · UTC+8</view></view><view class="events"><view class="event" wx:for="{{events}}" wx:key="time"><text class="sub">{{item.type}}</text><text>{{item.time}}</text><text class="green">{{item.value}}</text></view></view><button bindtap="stationWeather">查询本站附近天气</button><button bindtap="copy">复制官方逐小时数据链接</button><view class="sub">不包含风暴增水，不适用于航行或钱塘江涌潮判断。大陆免费站点接口尚未取得可用授权；不填入模拟潮表。</view></view>
